  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "**What information could make the thermostat more intelligent?**\r\n\r\nNotice the `turn` function has three parameters:\r\n- `up`, which is the number of people who prefer the temperature one degree up\r\n- `current`, which is the number of people who prefer the current temperature\r\n- `down`, which is the number of people who prefer the temperature one degree down\r\n\r\n**☑️ Do This:**\r\n- Run the program.\r\n- Notice the value of the parameters.",
    "offer_browser_tts": "false",
